[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17166.31, "timestamp": "04:46:06", "text": "おお。君はもうそれが戦いだと知っている、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17169.27, "timestamp": "04:46:09", "text": "兄弟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17178.27, "timestamp": "04:46:18", "text": "鏡を見たら、なんだか変な気分になった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17181.67, "timestamp": "04:46:21", "text": "わかった。モーションセンサーは必要ですか？何ですか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17185.67, "timestamp": "04:46:25", "text": "モーションセンサー？えーと、動きを検出する"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17186.86, "timestamp": "04:46:26", "text": "幽霊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17188.83, "timestamp": "04:46:28", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17195.19, "timestamp": "04:46:35", "text": "ええと、私たちはホラー映画が好きなんです。わかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17202.39, "timestamp": "04:46:42", "text": "お香。"}]